WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.813 --> 00:00:06.109
TALOS
Fury...

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:08.889
Since you've been gone...

00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:15.266
Things have gotten much worse.

00:00:22.186 --> 00:00:24.041
NICK FURY
Why do you think I came back?

00:00:30.247 --> 00:00:31.711
SONYA FALSWORTH
You're in no shape for this fight

00:00:31.761 --> 00:00:33.796
that lies before us, old friend.

00:00:34.581 --> 00:00:37.686
♪♪

00:00:43.548 --> 00:00:45.008
NICK FURY
This is personal.

00:00:47.209 --> 00:00:49.373
SONYA FALSWORTH
Very few of us know about the wars fought

00:00:49.423 --> 00:00:52.444
in the shadows that
have raged on this planet.

00:00:56.267 --> 00:00:57.580
Do you feel responsible?

00:00:59.316 --> 00:01:00.818
♪♪

00:01:03.439 --> 00:01:04.788
AGENT
Where are the Avengers?

00:01:08.486 --> 00:01:11.159
NICK FURY
This war is one I have to fight. Alone.

00:01:18.917 --> 00:01:21.725
JAMES RHODES
You're the most wanted man on the planet.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:25.718
G'IAH
You don't know what they have

00:01:25.768 --> 00:01:26.601
planned for you.

00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:32.518
GRAVIK
The great Nick Fury.

00:01:48.063 --> 00:01:50.350
NICK FURY
One last fight.

